          "All17 exact manufacturer STEP solids are separate fixed components, with explicit fixed connections for the soldered electronics and USB shell elements. The untouched source SHA256 is ea5c693afee3de73e9fcaab1892a5ed44bf789438b9b1e5906e9c4f9859cab8b. The source and successful assembly STEP export preserve these solids without artificial connecting material.",
          "These views verify nominal arrangement. Cable overmold fit, printed tolerances, screw torque and physical assembly are untested. The opaque lid covers the on-board LED; inspect the LED with the lid removed and use UART while closed.",
